{"id":"steam-5472990","steam":5472990,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"猫猫放置","summary":"MiaoMiao Idle is a healing-style cat-themed idle game. In the peaceful \"Cat Village\", you live alongside adorable cats — gathering, fishing, farming, mining, raising cats, building, and crafting equipment, enjoying a laid-back countryside cat life. ","about":"MiaoMiao Idle is a cozy idle game about life with cats. Fish, farm, and mine alongside your feline neighbors, then turn what you bring home into tools or cook a meal for the kittens.\n\nPlan your cats’ day and they’ll \\work through the queue in order\\. Go about your own day and come back to \\resources gathered while you were offline\\.\n\nGathering, fishing, and farming use up fullness. Cook cat food to fill up again or feed the kittens. Good at fishing? Sell your spare catch to other players and buy the materials you need. You can also turn some surplus resources into gold through alchemy.\n\nCraft tools and equip gear to work more efficiently. Build cat houses and workshops to unlock new features. For a change of pace, earn Paw Stamps from quests or head into battle for a chance at rare drops.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5472990/3a2b4328a7ebae70788c8b329f0d43dffb0ce2fb/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794621471","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5472990/183a45d976d0c28bf01bba0a6962dd901e664583/header.jpg?t=1794621471","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5472990/10ee1dab4aeaea8a3a9ddffb81f170deab4aa3e3/library_hero.jpg?t=1794621471","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5472990/183a45d976d0c28bf01bba0a6962dd901e664583/header.jpg?t=1794621471","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5472990/4b0548b52a1a6c164a01d2e56b7fc60fc6dda70d/ss_4b0548b52a1a6c164a01d2e56b7fc60fc6dda70d.600x338.j